@startuml SM2
!include style.iuml
title Figure 4.7: State Machine, Credential Lifecycle (FR-03 to FR-07)
hide empty description
[*] --> Draft : NIMC lookup succeeded
Draft --> PendingBinding : [level = L2]
Draft --> Active : [level = L1] / sign + print card
PendingBinding --> Active : [holder key bound] / sign
PendingBinding --> Draft : [binding cancelled]
Active --> Expired : [current date > expires_at]
Active --> Revoked : [officer revokes: lost device,\ndeath, fraud or re-issue]\n/ publish revocation list v+1
Expired --> [*]
Revoked --> [*]
@enduml
